WEBVTT

00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:07.280
Tomorrow's the weigh-ins, huh? Time does fly.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.440
Senpai's training has been very fundamental.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.520
The match is only days away, but he's done almost no sparring.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:19.070
I've got a bad feeling about this match. Really bad.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.950
Hey, boys, aren't you supposed to be training?

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.960
Yamaguchi-sensei?

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.570
Wh-Who's that nice-looking woman?

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:29.210
She's a massage therapist.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.470
So this is who Ippo-kun is fighting? He looks strong.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:39.680
So, where <i>is</i>  Ippo-kun? Your coach asked me to come see him.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.970
I guess he'd be inside.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:45.980
What are you doing? He needs you this instant!

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:50.230
This instant? Is Senpai hurt?

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:55.220
That fool did something reckless behind our backs.

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:12.250
How is he?

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.800
I'm surprised to see that he's gotten much more muscular, since I last saw him.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:22.430
He's really building up his body. I'm impressed.

00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:25.270
He has indeed increased his physical strength. However...

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:29.880
He's been taking things too far, 
especially at the knees and hips.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:32.410
I can see the accumulated inflammation.

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:37.280
I think he's been doing some intense stop-and-go twisting movements on his muscles.

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:44.070
I don't know what training he's been up to, but any further damage to his muscles will spell trouble.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:49.100
Serious injuries to the knees and hips are death sentences to an athlete.

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:54.130
C-Coach, what was Ippo...

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:56.050
What the hell's he been doing?

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.550
He's moving forward.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.550
He created a new Dempsey Roll!

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:07.550
It... It's all thanks to you, Coach.

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:11.560
If I didn't do your training regimen, 
I could've never done those moves.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.820
It's not exactly what I had intended,

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:18.070
but Sawamura will now be in for a surprise.

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.490
You mean it?

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:21.070
That's awesome!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.080
I can't recommend it!

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.140
He has already paid dearly for it.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.080
It's simply too risky.

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:36.110
Risky? If a licensed professional says it...

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:38.090
It's probably too much to ask.

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:40.040
I know I'm risking too much!

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:43.600
But I also know how it's going to end if I don't do this!

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.950
I guess there's no stopping you, is there?

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:48.600
That's just who you are.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.330
Very well.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.270
If you're doing it, do it twice.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.990
Two times, that's all.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:03:00.240
If you do more than that, your career will be cut short.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:05.910
You don't need to risk the chance of fighting future matches just to win this one.

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:08.880
Got it.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.010
<i>Two times.</i>

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.490
<i>If he's still standing,</i>

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.380
<i>then I'll...</i>

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.380
{OP}

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:28.190
<i>My senses are being honed thanks to my weight management.</i>

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.180
All that weight loss must've left you weak.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:54.550
We've been waiting for this. We'll waste you along with your title run!

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.690
What's with the silent treatment?

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.560
Did this knife shut you up?

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.230
You're not so goddamn tough! Hey!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.450
That's Ryuuhei's bike. What's it doing here?

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:39.000
<i>I'm thirsty...</i>

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.620
<i>Simply parched.</i>

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:45.100
<i>More... Let me drink more!</i>

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.780
Don't do it, Ryuuhei!

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.190
Kawabe-sensei.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.790
That's right, I was coming to see you.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.460
I had tickets for you.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:10.700
Thanks to you, I'm about to become the national champ.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.750
Me, the national champ.

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:16.600
I know you'll come see me.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.090
Oh, and thanks for stopping me.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:27.390
I was about to get my fill of their flesh and blood.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:37.820
I wish I could devour the best meat in Japan right now.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:44.390
<i>Did I make the wrong decision?</i>

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:50.760
<i>Did I err in introducing Ryuuhei to boxing in order to rescue him from his crippling isolation?</i>

00:05:55.930 --> 00:06:02.510
<i>Did I just accelerate his descent into madness?</i>

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.110
<i>The weigh-ins are almost over.</i>

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:16.230
<i>Makunouchi-san must be famished.</i>

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.530
Ryou! What are you doing here?!

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:26.600
Makunouchi called you last night behind my back.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:27.870
I swear to God.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:33.380
I can't believe he's pathetic enough to want to see a woman before a fight.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:37.670
I hear that Sawamura guy's a real badass.

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:40.570
I bet Makunouchi's balls shrank back during the weigh-ins.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.510
Sh-Shrank back?

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:47.070
Don't think about Makunouchi's balls!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.430
God! Are you out of your mind?!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.260
H-Hey!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.510
Wh-What the...

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.360
The customary handshake is going longer than needed!

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.380
<i>Sawamura's the one not letting go.</i>

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:02.360
<i>Things are looking pretty dicey.</i>

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:05.370
<i>What the hell's he trying to start?</i>

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.620
P-Please let go.

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.600
<i>It feels bunchy and stiff.</i>

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.920
<i>I thought premium meat would be much more tender.</i>

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:19.340
I'm hungry. I can't wait any longer.

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:22.380
Since we have spectators, why don't we do it here?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.230
What are you talking about?

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:26.890
The fight is tomorrow!

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.350
I told you I can't wait any longer.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:30.430
Sawamura!

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:32.390
You cool down, kid!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.900
Y-You don't even have to wait that long!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:41.940
We’ll fight in the ring tomorrow, fair and square and within the rules, after the starting bell!

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.500
Is that really Makunouchi?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:47.410
I've never seen him so tense!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:51.410
<i>Tomorrow's match is gonna be a rough one.</i>

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.660
Will you calm down?!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.230
The guy was ready to fight back there.

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:00.340
Or maybe he was trying to get into his head.

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:01.670
Yeah, I wonder.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:04.010
Kid, time to go.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:05.820
You made a date, remember?

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:10.670
You can't concentrate on a fight with your spirit out of sorts.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.180
Now go clear your head!

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.410
She's waiting for you.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.890
Oh, right.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.170
Sorry, I'll see you!

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:24.140
He's been brooding and training all this time, so he needs this.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.200
E-Excuse me!

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.450
Are you Makunouchi-san?

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:36.330
Um, yes, sir.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:39.470
Good luck in tomorrow's match!

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.960
Uh, thank you.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:44.970
Please...

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.260
beat Sawamura to a pulp!

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:51.740
He's such a poor soul.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:58.730
Because I introduced him to boxing, he's now uncontrollable.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:02.230
Are you related to Sawamura-san?

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:05.240
Yes. Yes I am.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:10.740
That's my intention whether you asked me or not.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.490
I will fight hard and get a KO tomorrow.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.440
Is... Is that right?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.050
Thanks. That's all I needed to hear.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.000
Please, do it.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:25.050
Please show him that there's someone stronger than him!

00:09:25.050 --> 00:09:27.960
I'm not sure what's going on, but I'll do my best.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.500
I have to go now!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.630
<i>Why?</i>

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:42.940
<i>I thought he was the only friend I had in the world.</i>

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.040
Kumi-san!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.080
Makunouchi-san!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.020
You're late!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.450
Wh-What is your brother doing here?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.080
He followed me!

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:00.580
Don't whisper behind my back!

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.150
I-I made some lunch.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:05.090
I thought you'd be hungry after managing your weight.

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:07.940
Oh, thanks a lot!

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:11.090
Let's get moving.

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:20.830
<i>Wh-What's going on here?</i>

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.870
<i>I was doing this to get rid of the tension!</i>

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.110
<i>But instead, I'm practically suffocating!</i>

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:27.970
<i>There's no saving this.</i>

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:31.610
<i>This opportunity only comes once in a blue moon. Stupid Ryou.</i>

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:34.690
What?

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:35.460
What is it?

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:36.370
Lookie here.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.370
I've always wanted something like this.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.340
A motorcycle?

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:44.190
Looks nice. Think I'll test drive it.

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:45.880
Mashiba-san!

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:49.380
You can't! It's not yours!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:50.740
Shoot.

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:55.530
Woman!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.810
Don't touch my bike!

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:09.400
Kumi-san!

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:11.750
Are you all right, Kumi-san?

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.910
I'm fine. He only grazed me.

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:17.960
<i>Grazed you? He took a full swing at you!</i>

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:20.980
<i>What boxer raises his fist at a woman?</i>

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:23.670
Sawamura-san!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.760
Next time I won't miss.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:33.760
You didn't miss. I dodged it.

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.720
You're dead.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.670
You want to take me on?

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.940
Get outta my way, Makunouchi!

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.790
This man's mine.

00:11:50.550 --> 00:11:52.190
Tomorrow <i>I</i>  will fight him!

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:57.200
You said there were rules in a ring?

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.430
You'll find nothing within that square ring.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:06.250
Nowhere to run, and no one to help you.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.660
I will slowly savor you then roast you alive.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:15.630
You two better scream when I do it.
 It'll make perfect seasoning.

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.700
We're leaving, Kumi!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.640
B-But...

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:26.500
Move it!

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:29.660
Kumi-san, go home and treat your injury.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:31.400
O-Okay.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:34.480
But, at least take the food.

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:37.610
Thank you.

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:41.260
Kumi-san.

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.350
Y-Yes?

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.390
W-Will you come to my match tomorrow?

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:47.920
I'll give everything I got.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:52.420
We'll need more than that. You need to tear him limb from limb.

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:56.420
I'm not sure if I can do that, but I'll certainly...

00:12:57.140 --> 00:12:58.970
<i>Two times, that's all.</i>

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:05.690
Please come and watch.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:08.190
If you do, it will boost my spirits.

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.440
Of course, I promise.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.840
What's with <i>that</i>  long face?

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:39.840
Umezawa-kun?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.180
Just turn things around like you usually do.

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:46.320
Sure.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:49.850
You've faced a whole lot of tough opponents in your career.

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:52.860
I sure have.

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:55.180
I see you're still less than excited.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.860
You know damn well the guy ain't tougher than Date-san or Sendou.

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.870
He may be tougher than you think, because he's capable of anything.

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:06.020
Capable of anything?

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:06.870
Yeah.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:13.380
Boxing involves trading punches, but there are rules and you play by them.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.920
If you ignore the rules, boxing becomes a very dangerous sport.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:22.390
Sawamura-san will cross that 
line without a second thought!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.550
Wh-Whoa...

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.750
He has to pay!

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:30.890
He's so strong! His jabs and straights are highly advanced!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.060
No normal boxer can replicate his counters!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.570
Hey, simmer down.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:43.390
Sawamura-san is good enough to become the champion one day.

00:14:43.970 --> 00:14:48.740
But I hate to see him become one if he ignores the rules!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:52.080
So, while I'm still the champ...

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.580
You'll flatten his ass yourself?

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:58.590
Well, not exactly flatten.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:03.380
I simply can't see the reason why he'd cheat if he's so good.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:09.530
<i>He was never this emotional back when we were in school.</i>

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:14.770
<i>I guess he can't stand people making a mockery of his beloved sport.</i>

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.840
<i>Sawamura-san is really strong.</i>

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:24.740
<i>If I can stop him, if there is even that slight possibility...</i>

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:30.630
<i>If you do more than that, your career will be cut short.</i>

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:36.700
<i>I won't limit myself!</i>

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.750
<i>I'll win even if I have to do that punch dozens of times!</i>

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:45.670
<i>Even if it turns out to be my last 
match... he'll never take my belt!</i>

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:55.270
Wow, it's been ages!

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.130
I knew you'd be coming!

00:15:57.130 --> 00:16:01.280
I know <i>I</i>  wouldn't be standing by quietly while 
Makunouchi fights a "Master Counterpuncher."

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.290
Why're you ignoring me?

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:08.660
Hold it right there, Miyata!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.560
What are you two fighting about?

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:12.790
Can't we all get along?

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:16.790
Though I <i>do</i>  sorta get why you're both so tense.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.380
Sawamura is one bad dude, I tell you.

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:23.150
Makunouchi will have his hands full with him.

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:25.510
I just hope he didn't bite off more than he can chew.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:27.550
Yeah, same here.

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:30.350
What a couple of pessimists.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:35.850
I know you must've figured out how to beat the Dempsey Roll.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:38.850
Yes, I have.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:43.460
Sawamura will make your worst fears come to life.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:46.860
It'll send shivers down the spine of every spectator here.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.300
I see.

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:51.370
Never thought I'd see you two so grim.

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:54.280
I guess it doesn't matter who wins.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.360
Neither is leaving here unscathed.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:05.530
H-Hey there, Ippo!

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:06.510
Umezawa-kun!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.270
I came here thinking I'd cheer you up.

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:13.830
But these waiting rooms are actually making <i>me</i>  nervous.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:18.740
Look, Volg taught me a special Russian charm.

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:20.020
He did?

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.920
Is that it for the semifinal?

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.700
That means you're up, kid.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:26.030
Come on, we're moving!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:27.530
Coming!

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:30.030
W-Wait, I'm going to say it!

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:32.340
Be sure to say your part!

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:33.030
Right!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.620
<i>Udachi tebe, synok.</i>

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.820
<i>Spasibo, mat!</i>

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.060
Yeah! Go get ‘em, Ippo!

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:48.380
I told him, Volg. Please give him strength!

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:52.140
<i>Thank you, Umezawa-kun, Volg-san.</i>

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.160
<i>I'm now ready for anything.</i>

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:57.480
Sawamura!

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:59.180
Hey, Sawamura!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.530
Your match is about to start!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.150
Aren't you going to warm up?

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:17.610
<i>He couldn't stand the abuse, so he stabbed his own father!</i>

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:20.040
<i>He wanted to save his mother.</i>

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:28.090
<i>Mom, about meat...</i>

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:32.090
<i>It's tough on the outside, but soft on the inside.</i>

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:47.770
<i>He still thinks his mother will come for him.</i>

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.820
<i>But she's never coming back.</i>

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:01.320
<i>I remember it like it was yesterday.</i>

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.880
<i>It was so delicious. I want to eat more of it!</i>

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:09.380
<i>You better let me savor you, Makunouchi.</i>

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:13.380
<i>Your meat is of the highest grade.</i>

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:20.910
H-Hey, look who's watching the match!

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.560
All the big guns have arrived!

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.730
The world champ, Takamura,

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.070
would watch since they belong to the same gym, but look over there!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:32.340
Those are former national champs, Sendou Takeshi and Date Eiji.

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:35.110
And that's the OPBF champion, Miyata Ichirou!

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:39.620
There's the junior lightweight champion, Mashiba Ryou.

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:42.170
Everybody has their eyes on this fight.

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:44.870
I can feel the tension already.

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:47.330
<i>Ryuuhei.</i>

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.380
It's finally starting.

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.880
All right, we're counting on you, Makunouchi.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:20:01.650
We will now begin the Japanese featherweight title match!
